When working in components directory:

- Always use Tailwind for styling
- Use Framer Motion for animations. Import it from motion/react as it's the newest version
- Follow component naming conventions
- New icons should be created inside icons folder and reused. Never as one-time implementation.
- Create new components for extractable parts during implementation of complex pages/sections.
